{"archetypes":[{"name":"ref-inventory","focus_area":"correctness","weight":1,"rationale":"The plan makes multiple grep-verified claims that no remaining references to deleted artifacts exist; an independent inventory check catches callsites the plan's grep may have missed.","prompt_body":"The plan deletes several scripts, a contract file, and fixture directories and asserts that specific grep searches verified no remaining references outside the listed edit sites. For each deleted artifact, independently check whether the reference inventory is exhaustive: scan Makefile, agent-lint.toml, docs/linting.md, SKILL.md, CI workflow files under .github/, hook definitions, .claude/settings.json, and any script that sources or imports paths matching the deleted names. Pay particular attention to whether test-rate-assertions.md or test-rate-assertions.sh appear in any cross-reference not present in the plan's file list, and confirm the fixtures/recompute-run/ directory is truly consumed only by the two deleted harnesses and not referenced by any surviving script or documentation. Also verify that the plan's claimed agent-lint S030 exclude entry is the only agent-lint.toml reference to the deleted files. Cite specific file paths and line ranges for any issues found, and follow the output-format rules from your outer wrapper exactly."},{"name":"line-ref-accuracy","focus_area":"correctness","weight":1,"rationale":"The plan cites exact line numbers for every inline edit; stale line numbers are a common plan defect that causes implementers to edit the wrong location or skip the target entirely.","prompt_body":"The plan specifies exact line numbers for every edit: Makefile lines 4, 12, 88, 102, 161-162, and 289-290; agent-lint.toml line 1245; docs/linting.md line 309; skills/report-tokens/SKILL.md line 31. For each cited location, read the actual file and confirm the expected token or text appears at or very near the stated line number. If a cited line number is off by more than a few lines, or if the expected content — the exact .PHONY token, the specific recipe, the SKILL.md trailing sentence — does not appear near that line, flag it as a plan defect that would cause the implementer to miss the target. Also verify that the two recipe deletions described as lines 161-162 and 289-290 span exactly a target-plus-recipe two-line shape and not a larger block that the plan silently truncates. Cite specific file paths and line ranges for any issues found, and follow the output-format rules from your outer wrapper exactly."}]}
